OL,3,A15 hikers feared missing after
OL,4,A'terrifying' flash flooding hits Grand
OL,5,ACanyon
OL,6,
OL,7,FAbout 15 people are thought to be
OL,8,Fmissing or unaccounted for after flash
OL,9,Fflooding swept through parts of the
OL,10,FGrand Canyon.
OL,12,FIt hit at around 14:30 local time
OL,13,F(22:30 BST) on Saturday in Bright Angel
OL,14,FCanyon and Phantom Ranch area,
OL,15,Faccording to the National Park Service
OL,16,F(NPS).
OL,18,FSixty-two people have so far been
OL,19,Fairlifted out of the area, with more
OL,20,Fexpected to follow. No injuries have
OL,21,Fbeen reported.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
