OL,3,A15 hikers feared missing after
OL,4,A'terrifying' flash flooding hits Grand
OL,5,ACanyon
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The whole thing was terrifying," said
OL,8,FNikki Baggs, 41, who was among those to
OL,9,Fbe airlifted out of the bottom of the
OL,10,FGrand Canyon on Saturday alongside her
OL,11,Ftwo friends.
